<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali federal forces and U.S. airstrikes have recently killed dozens of al-Shabaab militants in Lower Shabelle, while the U.S. has reversed its funding for international military support to Somalia. The Somali president has accused the UAE of financing armed groups, and al-Shabaab is reported to be collaborating with Houthi forces, threatening global trade. Drone attacks are intensifying, with new superpowers conducting strikes from above. A Somali-American Uber driver in Minnesota was brutally assaulted in an alleged hate crime, prompting community concerns. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168874&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5kNXpUczBINW1hMjFsNnhVWGpYZVFjR0FjV1ZwOGU1QmVjLW4wNnE2RnlUNnVxNGttbkU0S0x4NzJsbWhacmE2MG9pcTRzN0IwNGNJQkx4RVYyYnZlTnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Face2Face Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNbW9tQTNldlJmLWhXQXhKTmViTHlFVUV4TExJS1dKM1FtU2dIQ1lqYnNxaU41Yi1fUU13Q2N6UUY4WFZnNHZwOFg5ZlZPNFVjd3NBZ3l5OG4xRVhGWGhXdDU4bU81R1lkSUdDclBlY0xxdGJrdDJyRTJodzZna0tpMHVCbzIxdlZ4cVlwMmFQSnZmVnVBZVVvRHk1dDBSY242NHZTajc3M1J5bUdGVVIwVFlPNWVITkVobnY3eTJ4NWdlbjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNbW0wQXFvM3hRQkRRQnZJRWFScXRickRHNWpWcFBQcERMSm9Za3UxbjlmekE3ak9DUFZieHZEZDJSdHhrV1NjNWk0eWh3MHEzcTJKczdlOEhlODBwNkIwQWVDdE1Tc2lYbDRCdHlXWWF2a3cxWDU2WjRmbmthME5EcVNOMVgzNHBMV2JzcEdvc19HZ0xyX1lNalB5MEtPdFJtaXZucGQxOUE5RlBvOVdXRXJENnRGVzJ4bUJxSUotelFxU1VNdGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;MPR News&lt;/a&gt;,